{"response_code":200,"body":{"id":46713024,"created":0,"created_by":94125542,"title":"Speech","total_points":100,"realm":"course","realm_id":7919129162,"is_tracked":false,"rows":[{"id":130795289,"is_published":false,"term_id":null,"guid":"","title":"Message\/Purpose, \u0026 Organization","description":"(Structure, focus, clarity, and call to action)","columns":[{"pts":25,"description":"Exemplary\nClear, engaging introduction that captures attention\nPurpose and message are powerful and consistent\nLogical organization with smooth transitions\nStrong conclusion with a memorable call to action"},{"pts":20,"description":"Proficient\nClear introduction and purpose\nOrganization is mostly logical\nConclusion restates message but lacks full impact"},{"pts":17,"description":"Developing\nMessage is somewhat unclear or inconsistent\nWeak transitions between ideas\nConclusion feels abrupt or incomplete"},{"pts":13,"description":"Emerging\nUnclear or unfocused message\nLacks clear structure or flow\nNo evident call to action"}],"max_points":25,"weight":1},{"id":130795290,"is_published":false,"term_id":null,"guid":"","title":"Rhetorical Situation \u0026 Appeals","description":"(Exigence, Speaker, Audience, Context, Message, Purpose)","columns":[{"pts":25,"description":"Exemplary\nRhetorical situation is fully developed and intentional\nRhetorical appeal(s) are strong and balanced\nClear understanding of audience and purpose"},{"pts":20,"description":"Proficient\nRhetorical situation is mostly clear\nRhetorical appeal(s) are present\nAudience and purpose are considered"},{"pts":17,"description":"Developing\nPartial understanding of rhetorical situation\nRhetorical appeal(s) are evident or underdeveloped"},{"pts":13,"description":"Emerging\nMinimal understanding of rhetorical situation\nLittle to no evidence of rhetorical appeal(s)"}],"max_points":25,"weight":2},{"id":130795291,"is_published":false,"term_id":null,"guid":"","title":"Rhetorical Strategies \u0026 Reflection","descri